### Registrar un usuario
POST http://localhost:8000/api/register.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Lola",
  "email": "lola@example.com",
  "contrasenia": "lola",
  "rol": "Camarero"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8000/api/register.php
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "ana",
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "contrasenia": "ana",
    "rol": "Administrador"
}

